  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is morning. Lily is at school. Teacher Kim comes to the class. \"Good morning, class!\" \"Good morning, Teacher Kim!\"",
      "\"Sit, please.\" The class sits. \"Open your books.\" \"Listen, please.\" Leo looks in his bag. \"Where is your pencil?\" asks Teacher Kim. \"No pencil!\" says Leo. \"Oh no!\"",
      "Lily has a pen. She has two pencils. \"Here you are, Leo.\" \"Thank you, Lily!\" Leo is happy. Teacher Kim looks at Lily. \"Good friends!\" she says. She shows a thumbs up. \"Stand, please.\" \"Goodbye, class!\""
    ],
    "summary": "Teacher Kim says good morning to the class. Leo has no pencil, and Lily gives him one.",
